  intro s h0 hR hlt hF hC
  rcases coverL12567 s h0 (le_trans hR (by norm_num)) hF with ⟨a0, b0⟩ | ⟨a1, b1⟩ | ⟨a2, b2⟩ | ⟨a3, b3⟩ | ⟨a4, b4⟩
